			<item>
				<title>Weather Forecast</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/project/toolbox/weather-forecast/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/project/toolbox/weather-forecast/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;weather-wrapper&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;weather-credit-bar&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;path d=&#34;M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z&#34;/&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Weather and air quality data provided by &lt;a href=&#34;https://open-meteo.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Open-Meteo API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;weather-search-card&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;weather-input&#34; class=&#34;weather-search-label&#34;&gt;Search weather by location:&lt;/label&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;weather-search-box&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;weather-input&#34; placeholder=&#34;Enter city name (e.g. Ho Chi Minh, Tokyo, London)...&#34; autofocus&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; id=&#34;weather-submit&#34; class=&#34;weather-search-btn&#34; aria-label=&#34;Search weather&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                    &lt;circle cx=&#34;11&#34; cy=&#34;11&#34; r=&#34;8&#34;/&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                    &lt;line x1=&#34;21&#34; y1=&#34;21&#34; x2=&#34;16.65&#34; y2=&#34;16.65&#34;/&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                &lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;                &lt;span&gt;Search&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;weather-quick-tags&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;span class=&#34;weather-quick-label&#34;&gt;Quick suggestions:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;weather-quick-btn&#34; onclick=&#34;quickSearch(&#39;Ho Chi Minh&#39;)&#34;&gt;Ho Chi Minh City&lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;weather-quick-btn&#34; onclick=&#34;quickSearch(&#39;Tokyo&#39;)&#34;&gt;Tokyo&lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;weather-error&#34; class=&#34;weather-error-text&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;weather-history-section&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;h2 class=&#34;weather-history-title&#34;&gt;Recent Forecasts&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;div id=&#34;weather-result&#34; class=&#34;weather-results-container&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;script&gt;&#xD;&#xA;function quickSearch(city) {&#xD;&#xA;    const input = document.getElementById(&#39;weather-input&#39;);&#xD;&#xA;    if (input) {&#xD;&#xA;        input.value = city;&#xD;&#xA;        document.getElementById(&#39;weather-submit&#39;)?.click();&#xD;&#xA;    }&#xD;&#xA;}&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/js/toolbox/weather-forecast.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>A little update about me (Winter 2024)</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/note/2024-winter-update/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/note/2024-winter-update/</guid>
				<description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Cause, why not?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;3 months ago, I only dared to dream of getting into my dream university - &lt;strong&gt;HCMUS&lt;/strong&gt;. Now that I’m halfway through the first semester in HCMUS, I want to reflect on the experience so far.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;math-is-hard&#34;&gt;Math is hard&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Math here is freaking hard. I was and still struggling to keep up with the pace of the lectures. I’m not sure if I can make it through the semester.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Tic Tac Toe</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/project/toolbox/tic-tac-toe/</link>
